  "description": "The Micargi Marten 3.0 GS 26\"x3.0 Chopper Style Cruiser is built for riders who want bold style with smooth, easygoing performance. Rolling on oversized 26\"x3.0 tires, this bike offers a stable and comfortable ride while showing off its standout chopper-inspired design. The durable 36-spoke wheels keep things strong and reliable, while the springer fork up front adds a touch of retro flair along with shock-absorbing comfort. A simple single-speed drive train paired with a classic coaster brake keeps the ride low-maintenance and straightforward—just pedal forward to cruise, pedal back to stop.\nWhether you’re out for a relaxed beachside spin or just turning heads around town, the Marten 3.0 GS delivers a laid-back ride with plenty of attitude.\nSpecifications:",
